{"seq":1,"slug":"payment-method-plugin","title":"支付方式插件化抽象","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/local-payment-wallet-bnpl/unified-adapter/payment-method-plugin","wordCount":1967,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"支付方式插件化抽象\">支付方式插件化抽象</h1><p>第 20 种支付方式接入时，如果它需要修改核心收单代码，那么前面 19 次接入累积的技术债就在这一刻收利息。本文给出一个足够承受方式数量增长的抽象：把「支付方式」与「渠道」分成两个层级，把差异收敛进一组明确的接口方法，把路由与降级做成数据驱动的策略。这不是设计模式练习——每一个接口方法都对应一处真实的分叉，删掉任何一条都会在某个市场上以 bug 的形式回来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-渠道与支付方式是两层\">核心概念：渠道与支付方式是两层</h2><p>最常见的抽象错误是把 Stripe 和 PayNow 都当成 <code>PaymentProvider</code> 的实现。它们不在一个层级上：Stripe 是一个<strong>渠道</strong>（收单与技术接入方），它同时承载卡、Apple Pay、iDEAL、Klarna 等多种<strong>支付方式</strong>；PayNow 既是渠道也是方式。这一点有直接的公开证据：Stripe 的支付方式总览把可接入方式按卡、银行借记、银行跳转（Bancontact、BLIK、EPS、iDEAL、P24、TWINT）、银行转账、后付（Affirm、Afterpay/Clearpay、Klarna、Zip）、实时支付（Pix、PayNow、PromptPay、Swish 等）、便利店支付（Konbini、OXXO、Boleto、Multibanco）与钱包（Apple Pay、Google Pay、Alipay、WeChat Pay、GrabPay 等）分类列出，且明确「接入其中一种后，只需最小改动即可加入同类的另一种」（来源：Stripe payment methods overview, <a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/payments/payment-methods/overview\">https://docs.stripe.com/payments/payment-methods/overview</a>）。如果只建一层，就会得出「一个渠道 = 一种方式」的错误结论，于是同一个渠道接入第二种方式时要复制一遍全部的签名、退款、对账代码。</p>\n<p>正确的两层结构是：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[CheckoutService] --&gt; B[PaymentRouter]&#10;    B --&gt; C{可用方式判定}&#10;    C --&gt;|数据驱动| D[MethodRegistry]&#10;    D --&gt; E[PaymentMethod 实现]&#10;    E --&gt; F[Channel 适配器]&#10;    F --&gt; G1[渠道 A: Stripe]&#10;    F --&gt; G2[渠道 B: 本地收单方]&#10;    F --&gt; G3[渠道 C: 银行直连]&#10;    E -.多对一.-&gt; G1&#10;    E -.多对一.-&gt; G2&#10;    H[能力矩阵] --&gt; C&#10;    H --&gt; D\">graph TD\n    A[CheckoutService] --&gt; B[PaymentRouter]\n    B --&gt; C{可用方式判定}\n    C --&gt;|数据驱动| D[MethodRegistry]\n    D --&gt; E[PaymentMethod 实现]\n    E --&gt; F[Channel 适配器]\n    F --&gt; G1[渠道 A: Stripe]\n    F --&gt; G2[渠道 B: 本地收单方]\n    F --&gt; G3[渠道 C: 银行直连]\n    E -.多对一.-&gt; G1\n    E -.多对一.-&gt; G2\n    H[能力矩阵] --&gt; C\n    H --&gt; D</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>Channel（渠道适配器）</strong> 负责与一家外部机构通信的全部共性：认证、签名、HTTP 客户端、错误码翻译、限流、对账文件下载。它对支付方式是<strong>无知</strong>的。</li>\n<li><strong>PaymentMethod（支付方式）</strong> 负责一种支付工具在业务上的语义：它可用哪些币种、是否需要跳转、是否支持部分退款、有没有拒付、异步通知长什么样。它通过能力位声明自己的属性，通过组合一个 Channel 完成通信。</li>\n<li><strong>MethodRegistry</strong> 是方式注册表，是「有哪些方式」的唯一真相源。新增方式 = 向注册表加一个条目 + 提供一个实现，不修改路由与收单核心。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一个渠道承载多种方式的典型情况：本地收单方同时提供本地钱包、银行转账与现金凭证。它的 Channel 只有一份签名与错误码映射，而三种 PaymentMethod 各自声明能力位，其中「有没有异步通知」这一项在三者之间可能就不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"接口必须回答的六个问题\">接口必须回答的六个问题</h2><p>抽象的质量由它必须回答的问题决定。一个够用的 <code>PaymentMethod</code> 接口要回答六个问题，每一个都对应一处真实分叉：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>方法签名（示意）</th>\n<th>分叉原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>创建支付返回什么</td>\n<td><code>createPayment(intent) → PaymentAction</code></td>\n<td>跳转返回 URL、扫码返回码值、直连返回令牌引用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>怎么查状态</td>\n<td><code>queryPayment(paymentId) → PaymentStatus</code></td>\n<td>有的渠道只能按商户单号查，有的只能按渠道单号查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>怎么退款</td>\n<td><code>refund(paymentId, amount, idemKey) → RefundResult</code></td>\n<td>全退/部退能力不同，有的渠道退款不可撤销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能不能拒付</td>\n<td><code>capabilities.chargeback: boolean</code></td>\n<td>决定争议走哪条路径（见第 3 章）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有没有通知</td>\n<td><code>capabilities.notification: {mode, verify}</code></td>\n<td>有的无通知，只能靠对账</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>金额怎么表达</td>\n<td><code>capabilities.amount: {minUnit, rounding, multiples}</code></td>\n<td>最小单位与取整规则不同</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>PaymentAction</code> 是一个<strong>多态返回</strong>，它把三条接入路径的分叉收敛在一处：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type PaymentAction =&#10;  | { kind: &#39;redirect&#39;; url: string; expiresAt: Date }&#10;  | { kind: &#39;qr&#39;; codePayload: string; imageUrl?: string; expiresAt: Date }&#10;  | { kind: &#39;voucher&#39;; reference: string; instructions: string; expiresAt: Date }&#10;  | { kind: &#39;token_charge&#39;; tokenRef: string; requiresConfirmation: boolean }&#10;  | { kind: &#39;synchronous&#39;; status: &#39;paid&#39; | &#39;failed&#39;; channelTxnId: string };&#10;&#10;interface PaymentMethod {&#10;  readonly id: string;&#10;  readonly capabilities: MethodCapabilities;&#10;  createPayment(intent: PaymentIntent): Promise&lt;PaymentAction&gt;;&#10;  queryPayment(ref: PaymentRef): Promise&lt;PaymentStatus&gt;;&#10;  refund(ref: PaymentRef, amount: Money, idemKey: string): Promise&lt;RefundResult&gt;;&#10;  cancel?(ref: PaymentRef): Promise&lt;void&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PaymentAction</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'redirect'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">url</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">expiresAt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'qr'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">codePayload</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">imageUrl</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">expiresAt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'voucher'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">reference</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">instructions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">expiresAt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'token_charge'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tokenRef</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">requiresConfirmation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'synchronous'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'paid'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'failed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">channelTxnId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PaymentMethod</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> capabilities</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MethodCapabilities</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  createPayment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">intent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PaymentIntent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">PaymentAction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  queryPayment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ref</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PaymentRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">PaymentStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  refund</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ref</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PaymentRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Money</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">idemKey</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RefundResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  cancel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ref</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PaymentRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三点值得单独说明。<strong><code>createPayment</code> 只创建，不判断成功</strong>——只有 <code>kind: &#39;synchronous&#39;</code> 这一个变体可以当场宣布结果，其他四种都必须回到「等待外部事件」的收敛流程，这正是<a href=\"../global-payment-landscape/bank-transfer-otc\">银行转账、便利店与 OTC 现金支付</a>反复强调的纪律。<strong><code>cancel</code> 是可选的</strong>，因为不是所有渠道都支持撤销（跳转未完成时通常可以直接放弃，而凭证类必须显式作废，见同章第 2 篇）。<strong><code>capabilities</code> 是数据不是代码</strong>，它以静态属性形式暴露，使路由、结账页渲染、争议分流都能在不调用渠道的情况下做出决策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"能力位驱动路由与降级\">能力位驱动路由与降级</h2><p>有了能力位，路由就是一次纯函数的筛选，而不是一串 if-else。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function candidates(ctx: RouteContext, all: PaymentMethod[]): PaymentMethod[] {&#10;  return all&#10;    .filter((m) =&gt; m.capabilities.currencies.includes(ctx.currency))&#10;    .filter((m) =&gt; m.capabilities.payerCountries.includes(ctx.payerCountry))&#10;    .filter((m) =&gt; !ctx.crossBorder || m.capabilities.crossBorder)&#10;    .filter((m) =&gt; ctx.amount &gt;= m.capabilities.minAmount &amp;&amp; ctx.amount &lt;= m.capabilities.maxAmount)&#10;    .filter((m) =&gt; ctx.riskTier !== &#39;high&#39; || m.capabilities.chargeback)&#10;    .sort((a, b) =&gt; score(b, ctx) - score(a, ctx));&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> candidates</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RouteContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">all</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PaymentMethod</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PaymentMethod</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> all</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">m</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m.capabilities.currencies.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">includes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx.currency))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">m</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m.capabilities.payerCountries.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">includes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx.payerCountry))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">m</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.crossBorder </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m.capabilities.crossBorder)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">m</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ctx.amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m.capabilities.minAmount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ctx.amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m.capabilities.maxAmount)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">m</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ctx.riskTier </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'high'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m.capabilities.chargeback)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> score</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(b, ctx) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> score</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(a, ctx));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>score</code> 是排序而非过滤——它表达「在都能用的方式里优先推荐哪个」，输入是各市场的历史成功率、费率、用户历史偏好。注意最后一条过滤器：<strong>高风险订单只允许走有拒付能力的方式</strong>，这把争议策略与路由连了起来，是<a href=\"../chargeback-local/wallet-dispute-flow\">钱包争议流程与举证</a>要求的路由侧配合。</p>\n<p>降级是路由的伴生机制，它的设计原则是<strong>只在「确定失败」时降级，不在「未知」时降级</strong>。规则如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>渠道响应</th>\n<th>处理</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>明确拒绝（余额不足、参数错误、风控拒绝）</td>\n<td>允许用户换方式重试，原单作废</td>\n<td>结果确定，无资损风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超时 / 连接错误</td>\n<td><strong>不降级</strong>，进入查询确认流程</td>\n<td>可能已扣款，重发会造成重复支付</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渠道整体不可用（熔断打开）</td>\n<td>从候选列表移除该渠道的全部方式</td>\n<td>渠道级不可用，与单笔结果无关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通知长时间未到</td>\n<td>进入查询，不主动换渠道</td>\n<td>状态未知</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第二行是最容易被违反的一条。实现上应当把「换方式」做成<strong>新订单</strong>而不是改老订单，老订单保持 unknown 态并交由查询任务收敛；如果最终确认老订单已支付，则把新订单的支付退回或取消。这个模式与<a href=\"async-notify-variety\">各异步通知与对账协议的适配</a>中的「先查后决」是同一条纪律的两个应用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"注册表-配置与版本演进\">注册表、配置与版本演进</h2><p>注册表要回答的不只是「有哪些方式」，还包括「哪个市场默认用哪个」「哪个渠道当前是否可用」。把它做成纯内存注册表会导致改配置要发版，因此正确形态是<strong>注册表引配置，配置可热更新</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;methods&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;id&quot;: &quot;pix&quot;,&#10;      &quot;channel&quot;: &quot;local_acquirer_br&quot;,&#10;      &quot;enabled&quot;: true,&#10;      &quot;markets&quot;: [&quot;BR&quot;],&#10;      &quot;priority&quot;: 100,&#10;      &quot;limits&quot;: { &quot;min&quot;: 100, &quot;max&quot;: 5000000 },&#10;      &quot;fallback&quot;: [&quot;card&quot;, &quot;boleto_br&quot;]&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;id&quot;: &quot;boleto_br&quot;,&#10;      &quot;channel&quot;: &quot;local_acquirer_br&quot;,&#10;      &quot;enabled&quot;: false,&#10;      &quot;disabledReason&quot;: &quot;refund_channel_unavailable&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"methods\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pix\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"channel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"local_acquirer_br\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"enabled\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"markets\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"BR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"priority\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"limits\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"min\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"max\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5000000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"fallback\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"card\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"boleto_br\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"boleto_br\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"channel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"local_acquirer_br\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"enabled\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"disabledReason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"refund_channel_unavailable\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>fallback</code> 是显式的优先降级链，而不是「按 score 排序的下一项」——把降级链写进配置，才能在某个渠道出故障时由运维（而不是算法）决定流量去哪。<code>disabledReason</code> 强制填写，它使「为什么这个方式关掉了」成为可查询的事实，避免下一个人靠猜。</p>\n<p>版本演进方面有两条纪律。<strong>第一，接口只增不改。</strong> 需要新能力时加新的能力位与新的可选方法，不改已有方法的签名——因为同时在线的方式实现可能有几十个，改签名意味着几十次同步上线。<strong>第二，能力位是契约不是提示。</strong> 如果某方式声明 <code>refundSupported: true</code> 却在实际调用时抛出不支持错误，这属于违反契约；它会让上层的退款编排逻辑失效，进而造成用户已退货但钱未退。发现这种情况应当立刻修实现或下调能力位，而不是在上层加 try-catch 掩盖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>分两层：Channel 管通信共性（认证/签名/错误码/对账），PaymentMethod 管业务语义（币种/限额/退款/拒付/通知）；一个渠道可承载多种方式。</li>\n<li>接口必须回答六个问题；<code>createPayment</code> 返回多态 <code>PaymentAction</code>，只有同步变体可当场定结果。</li>\n<li>可用性判定是数据驱动过滤 + 评分排序；高风险订单只允许走有拒付能力的方式。</li>\n<li>降级只在确定失败时进行；超时与未知一律进入查询确认，换方式必须开新单。</li>\n<li>注册表引可热更配置；<code>fallback</code> 链与 <code>disabledReason</code> 显式化；接口只增不改，能力位是契约。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"支付方式插件化抽象","id":"支付方式插件化抽象"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：渠道与支付方式是两层","id":"核心概念-渠道与支付方式是两层"},{"level":2,"text":"接口必须回答的六个问题","id":"接口必须回答的六个问题"},{"level":2,"text":"能力位驱动路由与降级","id":"能力位驱动路由与降级"},{"level":2,"text":"注册表、配置与版本演进","id":"注册表-配置与版本演进"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"先买后付与运营商代扣","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/local-payment-wallet-bnpl/global-payment-landscape/bnpl-operator"},"next":{"title":"各异步通知与对账协议适配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/local-payment-wallet-bnpl/unified-adapter/async-notify-variety"}}